{
  "sn10.7:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 10.7 ",
  "sn10.7:0.2": "1. Indakavagga ",
  "sn10.7:0.3": "Punabbasusutta ",
  "sn10.7:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "sn10.7:1.2": "Tena kho pana samayena bhagavā bhikkhū nibbānapaṭisaṁyuttāya dhammiyā kathāya sandasseti samādapeti samuttejeti sampahaṁseti. ",
  "sn10.7:1.3": "Te ca bhikkhū aṭṭhiṁ katvā manasi katvā sabbacetasā samannāharitvā ohitasotā dhammaṁ suṇanti. ",
  "sn10.7:1.4": "Atha kho punabbasumātā yakkhinī puttake evaṁ tosesi: ",
  "sn10.7:2.1": "“Tuṇhī uttarike hohi, ",
  "sn10.7:2.2": "tuṇhī hohi punabbasu; ",
  "sn10.7:2.3": "Yāvāhaṁ buddhaseṭṭhassa, ",
  "sn10.7:2.4": "dhammaṁ sossāmi satthuno. ",
  "sn10.7:3.1": "Nibbānaṁ bhagavā āha, ",
  "sn10.7:3.2": "sabbaganthappamocanaṁ; ",
  "sn10.7:3.3": "Ativelā ca me hoti, ",
  "sn10.7:3.4": "asmiṁ dhamme piyāyanā. ",
  "sn10.7:4.1": "Piyo loke sako putto, ",
  "sn10.7:4.2": "piyo loke sako pati; ",
  "sn10.7:4.3": "Tato piyatarā mayhaṁ, ",
  "sn10.7:4.4": "assa dhammassa magganā. ",
  "sn10.7:5.1": "Na hi putto pati vāpi, ",
  "sn10.7:5.2": "piyo dukkhā pamocaye; ",
  "sn10.7:5.3": "Yathā saddhammassavanaṁ, ",
  "sn10.7:5.4": "dukkhā moceti pāṇinaṁ. ",
  "sn10.7:6.1": "Loke dukkhaparetasmiṁ, ",
  "sn10.7:6.2": "Jarāmaraṇasaṁyute; ",
  "sn10.7:6.3": "Jarāmaraṇamokkhāya, ",
  "sn10.7:6.4": "Yaṁ dhammaṁ abhisambudhaṁ; ",
  "sn10.7:6.5": "Taṁ dh